+uma_black_army:0 "Black Army"
+uma_black_army_desc:0 "The Umamusume army, trained by Eishin Flash himself, and bearing the name of one of Germany's elite armies. Each Umamusume in the army is the most powerful soldier and is equipped with the most advanced equipment. On the battlefield, they can defeat almost any kind of enemy."
