+﻿l_english:
+###飞升有关本地化###
+uma_abandon_normal_ascension:0 "Because of Umamusume's §Y Body §! And §Y Soul §! are §R Very Special§!, so they can't use the normal Ascension Path for the organism."
+###全身全灵
+ap_uma_zenshizenren:0 "Whole Body All Souls"
+ap_uma_zenshizenren_desc:0 "In the past, only a handful of elites in each generation of Umamusume were able to awaken the "Field" in the competition. Now, after a long period of statistics, research and experiments on the field, we have initially grasped the secret of the field:when the goals of body and mind are extremely unified, the field can be stimulated. \nNow, our scientists can adjust the emotions of Umamusume through psychological means, to achieve as much as possible the synchronization of body and mind and in this way stimulate the field. This allows Umamusume to open the "Field" not only in the race but also in their work in all walks of life."
+uma_will_enable_zenshizenren_ap:0 "We will initiate a §YSpecial Projects§! to help §YAll§! Umamusume§Yto open the "Field"§!"
+uma_requires_technology_uma_terriroty_in_use:0 "Need Technology §YThe Inspiration and Applications of the "Field"§!"
+uma_must_be_toresen_auth:0 "The Polity Must be §YThoresen College§!"
+###摘星
+ap_uma_fly_me_to_the_star:0 "Star Picking"
+ap_uma_fly_me_to_the_star_desc:0 "Once, the "Factor" just like a star in the night sky, intimate but distant and untouchable, she guiding the way ahead for each Umamusume, Generations of scientists have worked together to build a star ladder, Later, When children want to pluck the stars from the sky, Their Mothers can point to their daughters' chests gently, and said "The star is already here.""
+uma_will_enable_keisun_ap:0 "We will initiant a §YSpecial Project§! to help §YAll§! Umamusume strengthen their §YCommon "Factor" §!"
+uma_requires_technology_uma_complex_keisun_test:0 "Need Technology §YIntegrated genetic experiments§!"
