+uma_shop_gecha_times_allowed:0 "Not enough draws left!"
+uma_shop_center.11.b:0 "Come to send single draw!"
+uma_gacha_hint:0 "§Y Are you a lucky dog or not? The first draw will determine the outcome!§!"
