+uma_fallen_empire.100.title:0 "Akikawa Yayoi"
+uma_fallen_empire.100.desc:0 "Well...This year's carrot harvest is not bad...Ah, Wel!com! Have any questions for us?"
+uma_fallen_empire.100.desc2:0 "Doubt!Do you have any doubts this time?"
+uma_fallen_empire.100.desc3:0 "Cur!ious!If you have free time, can you tell me about your history?"
+uma_fallen_empire.100.desc4:0 "Ha!ppy!I have never had anyone to talk with me, so let's have a good talk today!"
+uma_fallen_empire.100.a:0 "Why you are called “Fallen Thoresen”?"
+uma_fallen_empire.100.a.response:0 "Ahem...It's just a name, it's not your business!"
+uma_fallen_empire.100.b:0 "The voice when we first meet was...?"
+uma_fallen_empire.100.b.response:0 "Oh, It is my friend's daughter, she read too many novels, ha-ha."
+uma_fallen_empire.100.d:0 "How about Fallen Thoresen's current scientific research?"
+uma_fallen_empire.100.d.response:0 "Nobody here will research those esoteric and obscure things. Most Umamusume think it's a good life. If I had to say, we have been researching how to make the carrots more delicious or improve the function of our VR terminal..."
