+CARROT_BATTERY_2_DESTROYER:0 "Crystal Reactors-MK2"
+CARROT_BATTERY_2_CRUISER:0 "Crystal Reactors-MK2"
+CARROT_BATTERY_2_BATTLESHIP:0 "Crystal Reactors-MK2"
+CARROT_BATTERY_2_TITAN:0 "Crystal Reactors-MK2"
+BIG_EATER:0 "The "Big Gullet" shield energy distribution system"
+BIG_EATER_DESC:0 "The analysis of the rate of stamina consumption during the race of the Umamusume has given us a new understanding of the ship's shield system, and the new system has improved the shield energy distribution, significantly extending its durability in battle"
+UMA_COMBAT_APPROACHING_SHADOW:0 "The looming shadow"
+UMA_COMBAT_REPLACE_ENTRY:0 "Succession burst"
+UMA_COMBAT_CLOSE_QUARTERS:0 "Fight at close quarters"
+UMA_COMBAT_FIRST_HAND:0 "First hand must win"
+SHIGE_HALO:0 "“Heavy field”"
+SHIGE:0 "“Heavy field”"
+FURYOU_HALO:0 "“Unhealthy field”"
+FURYOU_1:0 "§YUnhealthy field:For me§!"
+FURYOU_0:0 "§YUnhealthy field:For emermy§!"
+UMA_ATS-01:0 "“Acupuncture”"
+UMA_ATS-01_DESC:0 "Inspired by acupuncture techniques, we focus enormous amounts of energy into one place, thus weakening the enemy's armor."
+TWIN_TURBO_BOOSTER:0 ""Twin-turbo" reactor supercharger"
+TWIN_TURBO_BOOSTER_DESC:0 "The supercharger, named after the twin turbines, is capable of boosting the power output of the reactor."
+UMA_ARMOR:0 "Steady-state fermionic hybrid armor"
+UMA_ARMOR_DESC:0 "Hybrid armor composed of multiple fermions for increased protection at the subatomic level"
+UMA_ARMOR_S:0 "Small Fermion Hybrid Armor"
+UMA_ARMOR_M:0 "Medium Fermion Hybrid Armor"
+UMA_ARMOR_L:0 "Large Fermion Hybrid Armor"
+UMA_SHIELD:0 "High energy leptonic deflector shield"
+UMA_SHIELD_DESC:0 "A lepton-deflecting shield that is unaffected by strong interactions and can reduce the damage received by the hull"
+UMA_SHIELD_S:0 "Small High energy leptonic deflector shield"
+UMA_SHIELD_M:0 "Medium High energy leptonic deflector shield"
+UMA_SHIELD_L:0 "Large High energy leptonic deflector shield"
+UMA_JUMP_DRIVE:0 "Strange Tunneling Engine"
+UMA_JUMP_DRIVE_DESC:0 "The singular tunneling engine triggers and controls particles at the macroscopic scale to perform singular tunneling, which we still cannot explain its nature because of its origin from the Three Goddesses"
