+﻿l_english:
+#######Three Goddesses Knowledge Institute#######
+uma_threegodness_rd_country:0 "Three Goddesses Knowledge Institute"
+uma_threegodness_rd.99.title:0 "Three Goddesses Knowledge Institute Founded"
+uma_threegodness_rd.99.desc:0 "The Three Goddesses Knowledge Institute was officially opened today after the completion of a series of work such as site selection, recruitment of talents and equipment deployment. The Institute will be dedicated to collecting and restoring the knowledge left behind by the Three Goddesses, and transforming it into advanced technology that can benefit the Umamusume. With the first researchers in, the Institute has now gradually started to operate."
+uma_threegodness_rd.99.a:0 "We will finally know the secrets left behind by the Three Goddesses!"
+uma_now_you_can_find_rd_in_your_communication_menu:0 "Three Goddesses Knowledge Institute can now be contacted in the newsletter interface"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.title:0 "Special Week"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.desc:0 "Ah, is [Root.GetRulerName] ! May I ask what is the reason for coming here today?"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.desc2:0 "Um... This file should go here, and then that... Woah [Root.GetRulerName] !?"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.desc3:0 "Good, try to cheer up today too! Ah, [Root.GetRulerName] , hello!"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.a:0 "Access to the physics technology interface"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.b:0 "Access to the engineering technology interface"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.c:0 "Go to Sociology Technology Interface"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.d:0 "Tell me more about you!"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.d.response:0 "Myself? No, no, no, it's not that I hate it, it's just a bit of a surprise... In fact, my first goal was to become the first Umamusume of Thoresen Academy, and with Suzuka's help, I won the Thoresen Cup and realized my dream! Later, because I was interested in the knowledge left by the Three Goddesses, I came to the Institute, and I did not expect to become the leader of the Institute, hey hey..."
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.e:0 "What does this institute do?"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.e.response:0 "We Three Goddesses Knowledge Institute, is a great three goddesses left behind the knowledge of the piecing together, restore a lot of magical technology of the institution!"
+uma_threegodness_rd.100.exit:0 "End Communication"
+uma_threegodness_rd.101.title:0 "Special Week"
+uma_threegodness_rd.101.desc:0 "Hmm... Which physics technology do you want to analyze?"
+uma_threegodness_rd.101.desc2:0 "Any other technology you'd like to purchase?"
+uma_threegodness_rd.101.a:0 "Crystal Carrots Principle Explained"
+uma_allow_us_use_crystal_carrot:0 "We will analyze the crystal Carrots to prepare the theory for its further utilization."
+uma_threegodness_rd.101.back:0 "Back to the main screen"
+uma_threegodness_rd.102.title:0 "Special Week"
+uma_threegodness_rd.102.desc:0 "Hmm... Which engineering technology do you want to analyze?"
+uma_threegodness_rd.102.desc2:0 "Any other technology you'd like to purchase?"
+uma_threegodness_rd.102.a:0 "A first look at crystal carrot synthesis"
+uma_allow_us_produce_crystal_carrot_by_ourself:0 "We will be able to synthesize the crystal carrot by ourselves!"
+uma_threegodness_rd.102.back:0 "Back to the main screen"
+uma_threegodness_rd.103.title:0 "Special Week"
+uma_threegodness_rd.103.desc:0 "Hmmm... Which sociological technology do you want to analyze?"
+uma_threegodness_rd.103.desc2:0 "Any other technology you'd like to purchase?"
+uma_threegodness_rd.103.a:0 "The doctrine of factor-phase nature"
+uma_allow_us_choose_keisun_road:0 "We will be able to peek further into the §R factor§! 's' secrets."
+uma_threegodness_rd.103.b:0 "Field Theory"
+uma_allow_us_choose_soul_road:0 "We will be able to peek further into the §R Soul§! 's secrets."
+uma_threegodness_rd.103.back:0 "Back to the main screen"
